  m_Name: UI Framework Agnostic
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Trailback.Demo.Features.Data.FeatureDemoData
  featureName: UI Framework Agnostic
  shortDescription: Integrate with your existing UI architecture.
  fullDescription: "Trailback is designed to work alongside your existing UI architecture,
    not replace it.\n\nIt focuses solely on back navigation, allowing you to continue
    using your preferred UI framework, screen management system, and application
    architecture. Trailback simply resolves where Back should go next and leaves
    the UI implementation to your project.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n\u2022 Framework
    Independence\n\u2022 Flexible Integration\n\u2022 Existing UI Compatibility\n\u2022
    Minimal Project Assumptions\n\nBecause Trailback makes very few assumptions about
    how your UI is built, it can be integrated into both new and existing Unity projects
    without requiring major architectural changes."
  screenshots: []
